# ─── Debian "laptop" task — hard Depends + key Recommends ────────────
# task-laptop pulls `anacron` (Depends) + bluetooth, powertop, iw,
# wireless-tools, wpasupplicant, avahi-autoipd (Recommends).  Recs
# would be silently skipped if missing from pool, but most laptops
# expect them — ship all in pool.  Operator picks "laptop" task and
# all install (or laptop-detect auto-flags it).
anacron
avahi-autoipd
bluetooth
iw
powertop
wireless-tools
wpasupplicant

# ─── Debian "desktop" task — hard Depends + key Recommends ───────────
# task-desktop pulls xorg + xserver-xorg-* drivers + desktop-base
# (Debian theme — see TODO) + key system services (cups for
# printing, alsa-utils for audio, avahi+mdns for network discovery,
# xdg-utils for desktop integration, fonts-symbola for emoji
# fallback).  task-gnome-desktop further Recommends-on top of these
# via task-desktop's chain.
#
# TODO (folds into FORK-01 Step 7 athena-branding): replace
# `desktop-base` with Athena-branded theme/wallpaper package via
# Provides+Conflicts+Replaces or dpkg-divert.  Today's
# desktop-base ships Debian-themed wallpaper, GRUB theme, plymouth
# splash.  Tracked in fork-source.md plan.
alsa-utils
avahi-daemon
cups
desktop-base
fonts-symbola
libnss-mdns
xdg-utils
xorg
